== Notes ==

* This feat cannot be used while wielding a [[ranged weapon]].
* The prone state lasts for one [[round]] (minus the [[flurry]] in which the knockdown was made).
* A knockdown made on an already prone target will not increase the duration of the prone condition.
* Since monks receive this feat automatically, it cannot be selected when gaining a monk level (even prior to level 6).
* The combat log will report a knockdown attempt as '''*resisted*''' if the target won the opposed check and as '''*failed*''' if the target is not a valid target for this feat.
* Due to a bug, knockdown attempts that miss due to [[concealment]] will still deplete ''[[stoneskin]]'', ''[[greater stoneskin]]'' and ''[[premonition]]'', as if the attack had hit. There is no feedback regarding this.

